  ('Vortex Shaft - Falcon Compatible Spline', 'REV-21-2827', 'The Vortex Shaft - Falcon Compatible Spline is compatible with the REV ION System and gives users the ability to drive components that have a falcon spline bore. *Falcon is not a REV trademark. Featuring a 1/2in hex section that drives the shaft and a built-in taper for effortless self-centering, much like a milling machine. When you secure the shaft using a #10-32 Shaft End Screw, the taper keeps your shaft perfectly centered as it''s drawn in and locked into place within the NEO Vortex.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2827/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/810/images/3205/REV-21-2800-Shaft4-FINAL__99710.1698077344.1280.1280__90550.1698085810.1280.1280__69789.1703701297.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All / Discontinued & Discounted Products', 'rev'),
  ('Vortex Shaft - MAXSwerve Integrated Key', 'REV-21-2848', 'The Vortex Shaft - MAXSwerve Integrated Key is compatible with the REV ION System and gives users the ability to drive a MAXSwerve Module without the need for the MAXSwerve Key. This eliminates a potential point of failure in the MAXSwerve since the key is machined directly into the 8mm shaft. Featuring a 1/2in hex section that drives the shaft and a built-in taper for effortless self-centering, much like a milling machine. When you secure the shaft using a #10-32 Shaft End Screw, the taper…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2848/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/812/images/3207/REV-21-2800-Shaft1-FINAL__27396.1698077982.1280.1280__76890.1698085941.1280.1280__26226.1703701486.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Brushless / NEO Vortex & SPARK Flex', 'rev'),
  ('Vortex Shaft - 15T Spline', 'REV-21-2849', 'The Vortex Shaft - 15T Spline, compatible with the REV ION System and gives users the ability to drive inputs that have a 8mm diameter involute 15T spline. Compatible with SplineXS shaft components. Featuring a 1/2in hex section that drives the shaft and a built-in taper for effortless self-centering, much like a milling machine. When you secure the shaft using a #10-32 Shaft End Screw, the taper keeps your shaft perfectly centered as it''s drawn in and locked into place within the NEO Vortex.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2849/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/857/images/3407/REV-21-2849-VortexShaft-15TSpline-Top-FINAL__05008.1733516545.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('MAX Pattern Double Mount Adapter - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2859-PK2', 'The MAXPlanetary Double Motor Adapter seamlessly integrates with the REV ION Build System, enabling the side-by-side mounting of MAXPlanetaries, UltraPlanetaries, or SPARK Flex/NEO Vortex combos onto MAXTube - 2x1 with MAX Pattern. This compact solution is perfect for space-saving designs, allowing motors to be positioned tightly together for efficient use of available space. By enabling synchronized gearing of motion components, this adapter ensures precise timing and unison movement. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2859-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/863/images/3440/REV-21-2859-MAXPatternDoubleMountAdapter-Hero-FINAL__03266.1733955246.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure', 'rev'),
  ('MAX Pattern Plate - 1-Pos (2.48in)', 'REV-21-2860', 'MAX Pattern Plates are compatible with the REV ION System and feature the all-new MAX Pattern: a MAXSpline bore surrounded by #10 clearance holes on a 0.5in grid. The plates are available in various lengths, with the pattern repeating every 2in. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Weights: MAX Pattern Plate - 1-Pos (2.48in): 18g (0.04lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 2-Pos (4.48in): 32g (0.07lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 3-Pos (6.48in): 46g (0.10lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 7-Pos (14.48in): 101g (0.22lbs)…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAX-Pattern-Plates/?sku=REV-21-2860', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/695/images/2666/Untitled-11__24295.1650342342.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
