  ('MAX Pattern Plate - 3-Pos (6.48in)', 'REV-21-2862', 'MAX Pattern Plates are compatible with the REV ION System and feature the all-new MAX Pattern: a MAXSpline bore surrounded by #10 clearance holes on a 0.5in grid. The plates are available in various lengths, with the pattern repeating every 2in. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Weights: MAX Pattern Plate - 1-Pos (2.48in): 18g (0.04lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 2-Pos (4.48in): 32g (0.07lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 3-Pos (6.48in): 46g (0.10lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 7-Pos (14.48in): 101g (0.22lbs)…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAX-Pattern-Plates/?sku=REV-21-2862', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/695/images/2666/Untitled-11__24295.1650342342.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('MAX Pattern Plate - 7-Pos (14.48in)', 'REV-21-2866', 'MAX Pattern Plates are compatible with the REV ION System and feature the all-new MAX Pattern: a MAXSpline bore surrounded by #10 clearance holes on a 0.5in grid. The plates are available in various lengths, with the pattern repeating every 2in. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Weights: MAX Pattern Plate - 1-Pos (2.48in): 18g (0.04lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 2-Pos (4.48in): 32g (0.07lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 3-Pos (6.48in): 46g (0.10lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 7-Pos (14.48in): 101g (0.22lbs)…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAX-Pattern-Plates/?sku=REV-21-2866', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/695/images/2666/Untitled-11__24295.1650342342.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('MAX Pattern Plate - 11-Pos (22.48in)', 'REV-21-2870', 'MAX Pattern Plates are compatible with the REV ION System and feature the all-new MAX Pattern: a MAXSpline bore surrounded by #10 clearance holes on a 0.5in grid. The plates are available in various lengths, with the pattern repeating every 2in. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Weights: MAX Pattern Plate - 1-Pos (2.48in): 18g (0.04lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 2-Pos (4.48in): 32g (0.07lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 3-Pos (6.48in): 46g (0.10lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 7-Pos (14.48in): 101g (0.22lbs)…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAX-Pattern-Plates/?sku=REV-21-2870', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/695/images/2666/Untitled-11__24295.1650342342.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('MAX Pattern Plate - 15-Pos (30.48in)', 'REV-21-2874', 'MAX Pattern Plates are compatible with the REV ION System and feature the all-new MAX Pattern: a MAXSpline bore surrounded by #10 clearance holes on a 0.5in grid. The plates are available in various lengths, with the pattern repeating every 2in. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Weights: MAX Pattern Plate - 1-Pos (2.48in): 18g (0.04lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 2-Pos (4.48in): 32g (0.07lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 3-Pos (6.48in): 46g (0.10lbs) MAX Pattern Plate - 7-Pos (14.48in): 101g (0.22lbs)…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAX-Pattern-Plates/?sku=REV-21-2874', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/695/images/2666/Untitled-11__24295.1650342342.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('1 Piece Shaft Collar - Narrow - 1/2in Hex Bore - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-2900-PK4', 'The 1/2in Hex Bore Shaft Collars are used to prevent gears, sprockets, wheels, and other parts from sliding out of place on a 1/2in hex shaft. All REV 1/2in Hex Bore Shaft Collars feature a boss, or bump out, to contact the inner race of bearings that facilitate motion. To install the plastic 1 Piece Shaft Collar (REV-21-1911), tighten the screw with a 5/32in hex key to secure the shaft collar onto the shaft. The aluminum 1 Piece Shaft Collar - Narrow (REV-21-2900) uses a 2.5mm hex key to…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Shaft-Collars-0.5in-Hex-Bore/?sku=REV-21-2900-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/856/images/3591/Shaft_Collars_-_0.5in_Hex_Bore-Hero-FINAL__37835.1760543066.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('8mm Keyed Shaft Retaining Hardware Pack', 'REV-21-2907', 'Commonly included with our gearboxes and pinion options, the 8mm Keyed Shaft Retaining Hardware Pack is compatible with the REV ION System and includes the hardware needed to retain 2mm keyed elements to 8mm OD shafts without the bulk of alternative retention methods. Always having spares of these smaller parts can be imperative to quick repairs in the pits or in the shop. Specifications (REV-29-2598) Push-On Retaining Ring ID: 7.5mm (8mm / 0.315in shaft press fit) OD: 15mm (0.59in)…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2907/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/888/images/3481/REV-21-2907-8mm-Keyed-Shaft-Retaining-Hardware-Pack-FINAL__52949.1739478104.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('3in MAXSwerve V1 to V1.1 Upgrade Kit', 'REV-21-2986', 'These spare parts are designed specifically to self service and maintain your 3in MAXSwerve Module (REV-21-3005). Created for efficient repairs and upkeep, routinely servicing your 3in MAXSwerve Module with spare parts will enhance performance and condition. The 3in MAXSwerve V1 to V1.1 Upgrade Kit (REV-21-2986) brings a simplified motor keying approach to the main drive motor allowing for easier installation. A new version of the Encoder Bridge is included to adapt to the use of the included…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSwerve-Spare-Parts/?sku=REV-21-2986', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/776/images/3350/REV-21-3005-P23-MAXSwerve-Spare_Parts-HERO__23215.1728327233.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Swerve Drive / MAXSwerve System', 'rev'),
  ('3in MAXSwerve Module Wheel Hardware Pack', 'REV-21-2995', 'The 3in MAXSwerve Module Wheel Hardware Pack was designed for the 3in MAXSwerve Module. This kit is for FRC teams looking to streamline their wheel maintenance at competitions. With this kit, teams can pre-build their wheel assemblies, making it quick and easy to change out wheels on their modules at competitions or during practice. Kit Contents SKU PRODUCT NAME QUANTITY REV-21-3005-P15 3in Swerve Module - Wheel Hub QTY 1 REV-21-3005-P07 3in Swerve Drive - Wheel Bevel Gear QTY 1 REV-29-2951…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2995/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/756/images/3040/REV-21-2995-MAXSwerveModuleWheelHardwarePack-Iso-FINAL__59506.1669756437.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Swerve Drive / MAXSwerve System', 'rev'),
  ('3in MAXSwerve Module - SPARK MAX Mounting Bracket', 'REV-21-2998', 'These spare parts are designed specifically to self service and maintain your 3in MAXSwerve Module (REV-21-3005). Created for efficient repairs and upkeep, routinely servicing your 3in MAXSwerve Module with spare parts will enhance performance and condition. The 3in MAXSwerve V1 to V1.1 Upgrade Kit (REV-21-2986) brings a simplified motor keying approach to the main drive motor allowing for easier installation. A new version of the Encoder Bridge is included to adapt to the use of the included…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSwerve-Spare-Parts/?sku=REV-21-2998', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/776/images/3350/REV-21-3005-P23-MAXSwerve-Spare_Parts-HERO__23215.1728327233.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Swerve Drive / MAXSwerve System', 'rev'),
  ('3in MAXSwerve Module Bearing Pack', 'REV-21-2999', 'These spare parts are designed specifically to self service and maintain your 3in MAXSwerve Module (REV-21-3005). Created for efficient repairs and upkeep, routinely servicing your 3in MAXSwerve Module with spare parts will enhance performance and condition. The 3in MAXSwerve V1 to V1.1 Upgrade Kit (REV-21-2986) brings a simplified motor keying approach to the main drive motor allowing for easier installation. A new version of the Encoder Bridge is included to adapt to the use of the included…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSwerve-Spare-Parts/?sku=REV-21-2999', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/776/images/3350/REV-21-3005-P23-MAXSwerve-Spare_Parts-HERO__23215.1728327233.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Swerve Drive / MAXSwerve System', 'rev'),
  ('3in MAXSwerve Module Hardware Pack', 'REV-21-3000', 'These spare parts are designed specifically to self service and maintain your 3in MAXSwerve Module (REV-21-3005). Created for efficient repairs and upkeep, routinely servicing your 3in MAXSwerve Module with spare parts will enhance performance and condition. The 3in MAXSwerve V1 to V1.1 Upgrade Kit (REV-21-2986) brings a simplified motor keying approach to the main drive motor allowing for easier installation. A new version of the Encoder Bridge is included to adapt to the use of the included…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSwerve-Spare-Parts/?sku=REV-21-3000', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/776/images/3350/REV-21-3005-P23-MAXSwerve-Spare_Parts-HERO__23215.1728327233.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Swerve Drive / MAXSwerve System', 'rev'),
  ('3in MAXSwerve Module Spacer Pack', 'REV-21-3001', 'These spare parts are designed specifically to self service and maintain your 3in MAXSwerve Module (REV-21-3005). Created for efficient repairs and upkeep, routinely servicing your 3in MAXSwerve Module with spare parts will enhance performance and condition. The 3in MAXSwerve V1 to V1.1 Upgrade Kit (REV-21-2986) brings a simplified motor keying approach to the main drive motor allowing for easier installation. A new version of the Encoder Bridge is included to adapt to the use of the included…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSwerve-Spare-Parts/?sku=REV-21-3001', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/776/images/3350/REV-21-3005-P23-MAXSwerve-Spare_Parts-HERO__23215.1728327233.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Swerve Drive / MAXSwerve System', 'rev'),
