  ('3in MAXSwerve Wheel V2.0 - Plastic', 'REV-21-3004', 'These spare parts are designed specifically to self service and maintain your 3in MAXSwerve Module (REV-21-3005). Created for efficient repairs and upkeep, routinely servicing your 3in MAXSwerve Module with spare parts will enhance performance and condition. The 3in MAXSwerve V1 to V1.1 Upgrade Kit (REV-21-2986) brings a simplified motor keying approach to the main drive motor allowing for easier installation. A new version of the Encoder Bridge is included to adapt to the use of the included…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSwerve-Spare-Parts/?sku=REV-21-3004', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/776/images/3350/REV-21-3005-P23-MAXSwerve-Spare_Parts-HERO__23215.1728327233.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Swerve Drive / MAXSwerve System', 'rev'),
  ('3in MAXSwerve Module', 'REV-21-3005', 'The 3in MAXSwerve Module is the smallest and lightest swerve module designed for FRC Teams. Leveraging many parts of the REV ION System, MAXSwerve aims to reduce the complexity traditionally associated with swerve drivetrains. The module features a 3in wheel to ensure that your wheelbase is as wide as possible within your robot footprint. Designed with robustness and serviceability in mind, the module features an all-metal construction with steel drive gears. The rotation (azimuth) is…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3005/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/767/images/3496/REV-21-3005-3in1MAXSwerveModule_HERO-FINAL__58006.1748537163.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
