  ('72T - MAXSpline - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-3030', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern and MAXTube mounting pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - 1/2in Hex page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-Maxspline/?sku=REV-21-3030', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/855/images/3396/20DP-Gears-MAXSpline-Hero-FINAL__06440.1733360018.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('80T - MAXSpline - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-3034', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern and MAXTube mounting pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - 1/2in Hex page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-Maxspline/?sku=REV-21-3034', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/855/images/3396/20DP-Gears-MAXSpline-Hero-FINAL__06440.1733360018.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('3in MAXSwerve Spiky Wheel - Aluminum Hub', 'REV-21-3093', 'The 3in MAXSwerve Spiky Wheel Aluminum Hub is a durable replacement or backup hub designed specifically for the MAXSwerve system. Pair it with a fresh 3in MAXSwerve Spiky Wheel - Tread (REV-21-3094-PK8) and #10-32 3/8in button head screws for a high performance drivetrain. For quick full wheel swaps, combine this hub with the 3in MAXSwerve Module Wheel Hardware Pack (REV-21-2995), making it competition-ready in no time. Featuring a split tread mounting system, this hub allows for fast and…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3093/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/866/images/3438/REV-21-3093-3inMAXSwerveSpikyWheel-AluminumHub-Hero-FINAL__57979.1733951717.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Swerve Drive / MAXSwerve System', 'rev'),
  ('3in MAXSwerve Spiky Wheel - Tread - 8 Pack', 'REV-21-3094-PK8', 'The 3in MAXSwerve Spiky Wheel Tread is designed for superior grip and performance in competitive robotics. Made from injection-molded thermoplastic polyurethane (TPU) with a Shore A durometer of 95, this tread offers an improved coefficient of friction over traditional wheel designs, especially enhancing traction on carpet. The one(1)-piece split tread design allows for quick and seamless replacements without the need to fully remove the wheel, ensuring minimal downtime between matches. As a…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3094-pk8/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/865/images/3467/REV-21-3094-MAXSwerveSpikyWheel-Tread-Hero-FINAL__12911.1734654886.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Swerve Drive / MAXSwerve System', 'rev'),
  ('0.2in - 47in x 23in - MAXComposite Sheet', 'REV-21-3095', 'REV has introduced MAXComposite in two thickness options, making this high performance material accessible to everyone. MAXComposite is designed for applications requiring strength, impact resistance, and abrasion resistance, all while being 25% lighter than polycarbonate. Its exceptional chemical resistance ensures compatibility with Loctite and similar adhesives. MAXComposite is laser cuttable, allowing for fast and precise production of custom parts. MAXComposite is made from…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXComposite-Sheets/?sku=REV-21-3095', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/840/images/3358/REV-21-3098-MAXComposite-Hero-FINAL__77262.1729789067.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('0.1in - 47in x 23in - MAXComposite Sheet', 'REV-21-3098', 'REV has introduced MAXComposite in two thickness options, making this high performance material accessible to everyone. MAXComposite is designed for applications requiring strength, impact resistance, and abrasion resistance, all while being 25% lighter than polycarbonate. Its exceptional chemical resistance ensures compatibility with Loctite and similar adhesives. MAXComposite is laser cuttable, allowing for fast and precise production of custom parts. MAXComposite is made from…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXComposite-Sheets/?sku=REV-21-3098', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/840/images/3358/REV-21-3098-MAXComposite-Hero-FINAL__77262.1729789067.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Ballast Block - 3in x 2in x 1in', 'REV-21-3195', 'The Ballast Block - 3in x 2in x 1in is a steel weight block weighing 1.42 pounds (643g), designed for easy integration with the ION Build System. It features a staggered hole pattern with twenty (20) #10-32 counterbored through holes and twenty (20) #10-32 threaded blind holes across four surfaces, allowing secure mounting and modular configurations using either button or socket head screws. The 0.5in pitch aligns with ION structural tubes and bracketry, and the staggered design lets multiple…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3195/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/858/images/3413/REV-21-3195-BallastBlock-Hero-FINAL__32700.1733516724.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('1/2in Rounded Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1in OD - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-3197-PK4', 'Bearings 15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack (REV-21-3294-PK4) Featuring a 8mm internal diameter and a 1.125in outer diameter, this bearing is designed to fit into a MAXSpline bore while supporting a 15T Spline shaft. The flange adds a way to retain it in place while this bearing supports high-speed loads from many forms of mechanisms that are driven by a 15T Spline shaft including supporting the end of motor shafts. 1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Bearings/?sku=REV-21-3197-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/871/images/3433/ION_Bearings-Family-Hero-FINAL__10655.1733763769.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#10 Clearance Bearing - Flanged - 7/8in OD - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-3199-PK4', 'Bearings 15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack (REV-21-3294-PK4) Featuring a 8mm internal diameter and a 1.125in outer diameter, this bearing is designed to fit into a MAXSpline bore while supporting a 15T Spline shaft. The flange adds a way to retain it in place while this bearing supports high-speed loads from many forms of mechanisms that are driven by a 15T Spline shaft including supporting the end of motor shafts. 1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Bearings/?sku=REV-21-3199-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/871/images/3433/ION_Bearings-Family-Hero-FINAL__10655.1733763769.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Aluminum Angle - 0.74in x 0.74in - 47in', 'REV-21-3207', 'The Aluminum Angle 0.74in x 0.74in is a robust and lightweight solution for attaching and connecting components in your robot design. Made from the same clear anodized aluminum as MAXTube, this angle iron-shaped extrusion is designed for compatibility with the REV ION System. Its profile keeps it on pitch with MAXTube, ensuring seamless integration and alignment. With pre-drilled #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart, this 47-inch Aluminum Angle simplifies assembly while providing…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3207/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/864/images/3447/REV-21-3207-AluminumAngle-Hero-FINAL__81507.1734462719.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Left & Right Walls', 'rev'),
  ('4in - MAXSpline - Hard - Traction Wheel V2', 'REV-21-3280', 'ION Traction Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, durometers, and bores. Larger wheels contain the MAXSpline bore, but can be adapted to other bores with a separate MAXHub. Wheels with spokes have a bolt circle of #10 clearance holes patterned outward at 1/2in pitch and also have a 3/8in wide nut groove, which removes the need for a wrench when utilizing the holes on the spokes. Multiple wheels can be mounted flush next to each other when more…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Traction-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-3280', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/666/images/2646/Untitled-7__28355.1650296037.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x2 with MAX Pattern 4-Sides - 47in', 'REV-21-3286', 'MAXTube is compatible with the REV ION System and is a strong extruded aluminum tubing that features various hole patterns that make robot structures easier to build. Hole patterns range from simple #10 clearance hole grid patterns to a repeated MAX Pattern every 2in. The MAX Pattern features the MAXSpline bore with an array of #10 clearance holes on either side. It allows for easy installation of bearing for different live axle applications, as well as correct center-to-center distances for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x2/?sku=REV-21-3286', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/854/images/3382/REV-21-3286-MAXTube2x2-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__97360.1732749964.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure / MAXTube', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x2 with MAX and Grid Pattern - 47in', 'REV-21-3287', 'MAXTube is compatible with the REV ION System and is a strong extruded aluminum tubing that features various hole patterns that make robot structures easier to build. Hole patterns range from simple #10 clearance hole grid patterns to a repeated MAX Pattern every 2in. The MAX Pattern features the MAXSpline bore with an array of #10 clearance holes on either side. It allows for easy installation of bearing for different live axle applications, as well as correct center-to-center distances for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x2/?sku=REV-21-3287', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/854/images/3382/REV-21-3286-MAXTube2x2-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__97360.1732749964.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure / MAXTube', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x2 with Grid Pattern 4-Sides - 47in', 'REV-21-3288', 'MAXTube is compatible with the REV ION System and is a strong extruded aluminum tubing that features various hole patterns that make robot structures easier to build. Hole patterns range from simple #10 clearance hole grid patterns to a repeated MAX Pattern every 2in. The MAX Pattern features the MAXSpline bore with an array of #10 clearance holes on either side. It allows for easy installation of bearing for different live axle applications, as well as correct center-to-center distances for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x2/?sku=REV-21-3288', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/854/images/3382/REV-21-3286-MAXTube2x2-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__97360.1732749964.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure / MAXTube', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 1/2x1/2', 'REV-21-3289', 'MAXTube is compatible with the REV ION System and is a strong extruded aluminum tubing that features various hole patterns that make robot structures easier to build. Hole patterns range from simple #10 clearance hole grid patterns to a repeated MAX Pattern every 2in. The MAX Pattern features the MAXSpline bore with an array of #10 clearance holes on either side. It allows for easy installation of bearing for different live axle applications, as well as correct center-to-center distances for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-0.5x0.5/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/851/images/3379/REV-21-3289-MAXTube0.5-Hero-FINAL__26762.1732745664.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('1in Angled Corner Bracket - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-3291-PK2', 'The 1in Angled Corner Bracket is a compact, heavy duty solution for reinforcing MAXTube joints and building rigid structures in tight spaces. Its 5mm thick aluminum body provides consistent strength, while the integrated angle dramatically boosts joint stiffness by resisting torsion and bending loads. Each end of the bracket includes two #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch, giving teams flexible mounting options for corner reinforcement or general structure assembly. At only 1in wide, it…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3291-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/946/images/3642/REV-21-3291_angledcornerbracket_HERO_FINAL__58306.1764890244.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('1in Basic Corner Bracket - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-3293-PK2', 'The 1in Basic Corner Bracket is a compact, low profile solution for strengthening MAXTube joints or adding simple mounting points where space is limited. Its 5mm thick aluminum construction provides dependable stiffness without the added bulk of a gusseted design, making it ideal for tight assemblies that still need structural support. Each 2in leg includes three #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch, and the clearance holes in the radiused bend offers screw head clearance. The 1in width aligns…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3293-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/947/images/3656/REV-21-3293_basiccornerbracket_HERO_FINAL_1__52828.1764893667.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Left & Right Walls', 'rev'),
  ('15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-3294-PK4', 'Bearings 15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack (REV-21-3294-PK4) Featuring a 8mm internal diameter and a 1.125in outer diameter, this bearing is designed to fit into a MAXSpline bore while supporting a 15T Spline shaft. The flange adds a way to retain it in place while this bearing supports high-speed loads from many forms of mechanisms that are driven by a 15T Spline shaft including supporting the end of motor shafts. 1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Bearings/?sku=REV-21-3294-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/871/images/3433/ION_Bearings-Family-Hero-FINAL__10655.1733763769.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit - Top Mount', 'REV-21-3297', 'The MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit and MAXSpline Bearings are compatible with the REV ION System and are perfect for using MAXSpline Shaft in a live axle application or any other similar sized rotational needs. Effortlessly mounting to REV''s hole pattern standards, these blocks are quick and versatile. Get things prototyped quickly with the flexibility of adjustment to deploy or create your perfect mechanisms! REV recommends supporting most applications with a minimum of two MAXSpline Shaft…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxspline-shaft-bearing-blocks/?sku=REV-21-3297', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/818/images/3257/REV-21-0000-MAXSplineShaftBearingBlockSideMount-FamilyHero-FINAL__02108.1704464648.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit - Side Mount', 'REV-21-3298', 'The MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit and MAXSpline Bearings are compatible with the REV ION System and are perfect for using MAXSpline Shaft in a live axle application or any other similar sized rotational needs. Effortlessly mounting to REV''s hole pattern standards, these blocks are quick and versatile. Get things prototyped quickly with the flexibility of adjustment to deploy or create your perfect mechanisms! REV recommends supporting most applications with a minimum of two MAXSpline Shaft…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxspline-shaft-bearing-blocks/?sku=REV-21-3298', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/818/images/3257/REV-21-0000-MAXSplineShaftBearingBlockSideMount-FamilyHero-FINAL__02108.1704464648.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit - Parallel Mount', 'REV-21-3299', 'The MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit and MAXSpline Bearings are compatible with the REV ION System and are perfect for using MAXSpline Shaft in a live axle application or any other similar sized rotational needs. Effortlessly mounting to REV''s hole pattern standards, these blocks are quick and versatile. Get things prototyped quickly with the flexibility of adjustment to deploy or create your perfect mechanisms! REV recommends supporting most applications with a minimum of two MAXSpline Shaft…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxspline-shaft-bearing-blocks/?sku=REV-21-3299', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/818/images/3257/REV-21-0000-MAXSplineShaftBearingBlockSideMount-FamilyHero-FINAL__02108.1704464648.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit - Perpendicular Mount', 'REV-21-3300', 'The MAXSpline Shaft Bearing Block Kit and MAXSpline Bearings are compatible with the REV ION System and are perfect for using MAXSpline Shaft in a live axle application or any other similar sized rotational needs. Effortlessly mounting to REV''s hole pattern standards, these blocks are quick and versatile. Get things prototyped quickly with the flexibility of adjustment to deploy or create your perfect mechanisms! REV recommends supporting most applications with a minimum of two MAXSpline Shaft…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxspline-shaft-bearing-blocks/?sku=REV-21-3300', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/818/images/3257/REV-21-0000-MAXSplineShaftBearingBlockSideMount-FamilyHero-FINAL__02108.1704464648.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('14T (16T C-C) - 1/2in Rounded Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-3361', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-3361', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('15T (16T C-C) - 1/2in Rounded Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-3362', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-3362', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#25 Billet Sprocket - 40T', 'REV-21-3370', 'ION #25 Sprockets are compatible with the REV ION System and designed for use with #25 Roller chain. #25 Plate Sprockets: Featuring MAXSpline and a 2in bolt circle that patterns outward radially, allowing for bolting to structure easily. #25 Hub Sprockets: Featuring a 1/2in Hex bore or MAXSpline and transfer torque through a shaft. 1/2in Hex - 16 Tooth - Double sprockets available for chain in tube applications. #25 Billet Sprockets: Featuring a 2in bolt circle that patterns outward radially,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-25-Sprockets/?sku=REV-21-3370', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/659/images/3405/25_Sprockets-Family-Hero-FINAL__68666.1733438402.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('#25 Billet Sprocket - 48T', 'REV-21-3374', 'ION #25 Sprockets are compatible with the REV ION System and designed for use with #25 Roller chain. #25 Plate Sprockets: Featuring MAXSpline and a 2in bolt circle that patterns outward radially, allowing for bolting to structure easily. #25 Hub Sprockets: Featuring a 1/2in Hex bore or MAXSpline and transfer torque through a shaft. 1/2in Hex - 16 Tooth - Double sprockets available for chain in tube applications. #25 Billet Sprockets: Featuring a 2in bolt circle that patterns outward radially,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-25-Sprockets/?sku=REV-21-3374', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/659/images/3405/25_Sprockets-Family-Hero-FINAL__68666.1733438402.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
