  ('3/8in Nut Strip - 11 Pos - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-3428-PK2', '3/8 Nut Strips are compatible with the REV ION System featuring convenient 1/2in spaced #10-32 threaded holes that are inline with each other allowing easy fastening of aligned plates and structure without the need for individual nuts. Specifications Material: 6061 Aluminum Finish: Black Anodized Thread Pitch: #10-32 Width: 0.375in (9.53mm) Height: 0.375in (9.53mm) Length: 3/8 Nut Strip - 3 Pos: 1.5in (37.59mm) 3/8 Nut Strip - 5 Pos: 2.5in (62.99mm) 3/8 Nut Strip - 7 Pos: 3.5in (88.39mm) 3/8…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/3-8in-nut-strips/?sku=REV-21-3428-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/821/images/3590/3-8nutstrip_FAMILY_FINAL__50961.1760542325.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('3/8in Nut Strip - 13 Pos - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-3430-PK2', '3/8 Nut Strips are compatible with the REV ION System featuring convenient 1/2in spaced #10-32 threaded holes that are inline with each other allowing easy fastening of aligned plates and structure without the need for individual nuts. Specifications Material: 6061 Aluminum Finish: Black Anodized Thread Pitch: #10-32 Width: 0.375in (9.53mm) Height: 0.375in (9.53mm) Length: 3/8 Nut Strip - 3 Pos: 1.5in (37.59mm) 3/8 Nut Strip - 5 Pos: 2.5in (62.99mm) 3/8 Nut Strip - 7 Pos: 3.5in (88.39mm) 3/8…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/3-8in-nut-strips/?sku=REV-21-3430-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/821/images/3590/3-8nutstrip_FAMILY_FINAL__50961.1760542325.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shaft Collar - 2 Piece - Narrow - Aluminum', 'REV-21-3476', 'MAXSpline Shaft Collars provide mechanical retention for components mounted on MAXSpline Shaft and use a two piece aluminum clamping design for secure attachment. Both versions are black anodized for durability and integrate cleanly within the REV ION System. The narrow profile collar is intended for applications with strict space or weight constraints. It uses M3 hardware to minimize overall size, resulting in a 0.25in wide collar with a 1.88in outer diameter. Its compact geometry allows it…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-MAXSpline-Shaft-Collars?sku=REV-21-3476', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/691/images/3842/REV-21-2581-3476_ShaftCollarFinaly_Edited_FINAL__69187.1780433549.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('#25 NEO Pinion Sprocket - 8mm Keyed - 12', 'REV-21-3495', 'The NEO Pinions are used for transferring power from a NEO Brushless Motor or something with a similar matching shaft to a mechanism. These pinions come in three different types; either gear, sprocket, or pulley. The pinion gears are compatible with 20DP gears. The pinion sprocket is used with #25 chain and the pinion pulley is used with GT2 3mm timing belts. These pinions either come compatible with 8mm round shafts with a 2mm keyway or 15T Spline shafts. The 10, 11, and 12 Tooth Pinion Gears…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/neo-pinions/?sku=REV-21-3495', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/588/images/1850/REV-21-0000-Pinion_Gear-Family-FINAL__60560.1612816510.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('MAXLift #25 Chain Attachment Plate - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-3535-PK2', 'The MAXLift #25 Chain Attachment Plate is a durable yet lightweight aluminum bracket designed for seamless use with the REV ION system within the MAXLift family of products. It simplifies mounting and assembly for elevator and lift systems. Featuring three 5.2mm holes for #10 screw clearance and five 3.5mm holes for M3 screw clearance, this plate is ideal for creating compact elevator systems. The 5mm holes align perfectly with the 3/8in Nut Strip – 5 Pos (REV-21-3422-PK2) for secure…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3535/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/876/images/3471/REV-21-3535-MAXLift-_25-Chain-Attachment-Plate-TOP__25601.1736275736.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / FRC Voucher', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x1 - 1/16in Wall - Grid Pattern - 47in', 'REV-21-3552', 'MAXTube 2x1 is durable, extruded aluminum tubing optimized for robot structures and fully compatible with the REV ION System. It features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all 1-inch sides and offers multiple configurations: solid, grid pattern, or the MAX Pattern with MAXSpline cutouts every 2 inches and 0.196-inch holes on a 0.5-inch pitch. With variable wall thickness for tailored strength-to-weight ratios, MAXTube 2x1 streamlines precise, efficient structural design. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x1/?sku=REV-21-3552', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/853/images/3381/REV-21-2185-MAXTube2x1-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__82090.1732749034.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
