  ('MAXTube Internal Support - 1x1 - 1/16in Wall - 30 Pack', 'REV-21-3617-PK30', 'MAXTube Internal Supports are compatible with the REV ION System and facilitate bolt-through assembly within a MAXTube without causing permanent deformation. Crucial for ensuring structurally sound through-bolted joints and allows multiple supports to be seamlessly slid into a MAXTube to accommodate multiple screws. Features Clearance for #10 screws Provides screw placement in any available hole within MAXTube Thin profile allows for multiple to be used on adjacent holes Specifications…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxtube-internal-supports/?sku=REV-21-3617-PK30', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/819/images/3475/MAXTube_Internal_Support-HERO__14979.1739308563.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
