  ('MAXTube Internal Support - 2x1 - 1/16in Wall - 30 Pack', 'REV-21-3619-PK30', 'MAXTube Internal Supports are compatible with the REV ION System and facilitate bolt-through assembly within a MAXTube without causing permanent deformation. Crucial for ensuring structurally sound through-bolted joints and allows multiple supports to be seamlessly slid into a MAXTube to accommodate multiple screws. Features Clearance for #10 screws Provides screw placement in any available hole within MAXTube Thin profile allows for multiple to be used on adjacent holes Specifications…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxtube-internal-supports/?sku=REV-21-3619-PK30', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/819/images/3475/MAXTube_Internal_Support-HERO__14979.1739308563.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube Internal Support - 2x1 - 1/8in Wall - 30 Pack', 'REV-21-3620-PK30', 'MAXTube Internal Supports are compatible with the REV ION System and facilitate bolt-through assembly within a MAXTube without causing permanent deformation. Crucial for ensuring structurally sound through-bolted joints and allows multiple supports to be seamlessly slid into a MAXTube to accommodate multiple screws. Features Clearance for #10 screws Provides screw placement in any available hole within MAXTube Thin profile allows for multiple to be used on adjacent holes Specifications…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxtube-internal-supports/?sku=REV-21-3620-PK30', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/819/images/3475/MAXTube_Internal_Support-HERO__14979.1739308563.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube Internal Support - 2x1 - 3/16in Wall - 30 Pack', 'REV-21-3623-PK30', 'MAXTube Internal Supports are compatible with the REV ION System and facilitate bolt-through assembly within a MAXTube without causing permanent deformation. Crucial for ensuring structurally sound through-bolted joints and allows multiple supports to be seamlessly slid into a MAXTube to accommodate multiple screws. Features Clearance for #10 screws Provides screw placement in any available hole within MAXTube Thin profile allows for multiple to be used on adjacent holes Specifications…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxtube-internal-supports/?sku=REV-21-3623-PK30', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/819/images/3475/MAXTube_Internal_Support-HERO__14979.1739308563.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary MAXSpline Output Coupler', 'REV-21-3630', 'The MAXPlanetary MAXSpline Output Coupler [REV-21-3630] provides a compact and reliable way to interface a MAXPlanetary Gearbox''s 1/2 inch hex output with MAXSpline Shaft systems. Designed for teams who want the packaging efficiency of a MAXPlanetary combined with the structural and rotational advantages of MAXSpline, this coupler makes inline mechanisms simple and secure. one(2) side of the coupler accepts up to 0.47 inch of 1/2 inch hex shaft and uses a #10-32 screw that threads into the shaft…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3630/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/937/images/3734/REV-21-3630_MAXPlanetaryOutput_Hero_FINAL__94405.1767812770.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes / MAXPlanetary System', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Grommet - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-3640-PK10', 'The MAXSpline Grommet provides a simple way to route wires through MAXTube while preventing abrasion against bare aluminum. Made from pliable 60A rubber, it press-fits into the MAXSpline Bore on MAXTube with a 1/8 inch wall, creating a clean pass-through point that protects your wiring in any build. Each pack includes ten grommets. Features Protects wires from abrasion Made of pliable 60 Shore A rubber Fits MAXSpline Bore in MAXTube with a 1/8in wall thickness Specifications Material: Rubber…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-3640-pk10/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/927/images/3622/grommet_hero_FINAL__63483.1763742071.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('Motor Mounting Clamping Block', 'REV-21-3662', 'The ION Motor Mounting Blocks family offers two options for securely mounting motors and supporting extended shafts within robot mechanisms. Both versions use aluminum plates with integrated MAXSpline bores and bearing pockets, providing a consistent interface for shaft support and power transmission. Teams can choose either a fixed mounting block for on pitch structure or a clamping version for adjustable positioning on 2x1 or 1x1 tube, depending on the needs of their mechanism. Motor…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Motor-Mounting-Blocks?sku=REV-21-3662', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/950/images/3726/IONMotorMountingBlocks_FAMILY_FINAL__32008.1765819991.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('ION Motor Mounting Blocks', 'REV-21-3663', 'The ION Motor Mounting Blocks family offers two options for securely mounting motors and supporting extended shafts within robot mechanisms. Both versions use aluminum plates with integrated MAXSpline bores and bearing pockets, providing a consistent interface for shaft support and power transmission. Teams can choose either a fixed mounting block for on pitch structure or a clamping version for adjustable positioning on 2x1 or 1x1 tube, depending on the needs of their mechanism. Motor…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Motor-Mounting-Blocks?sku=REV-21-3663', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/950/images/3726/IONMotorMountingBlocks_FAMILY_FINAL__32008.1765819991.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('#35 Chain Turnbuckle', 'REV-21-3705', 'Designed for teams requiring higher load capacity in chain-driven systems, the ION #35 Sprockets come in three versatile options, each compatible with the REV ION Build System: #35 Hub Sprockets - 1/2in Hex: Featuring a 1/2in hex bore (rounded for the 9T size) and dual raised hubs for centered alignment on a 0.5in width, these sprockets are ideal for compact spaces. The 1/2in hex bore enables the smallest sprockets with the fewest teeth, accommodating a wider range of reduction options. Our…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-35-Sprockets/?sku=REV-21-3705', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/867/images/3435/REV-21-3706-3731-ION35Sprockets-FamilyHero-FINAL__40419.1733848051.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
