  ('#35 Connecting Links - 5 Pack', 'REV-21-3744-PK5', 'Designed for teams requiring higher load capacity in chain-driven systems, the ION #35 Sprockets come in three versatile options, each compatible with the REV ION Build System: #35 Hub Sprockets - 1/2in Hex: Featuring a 1/2in hex bore (rounded for the 9T size) and dual raised hubs for centered alignment on a 0.5in width, these sprockets are ideal for compact spaces. The 1/2in hex bore enables the smallest sprockets with the fewest teeth, accommodating a wider range of reduction options. Our…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-35-Sprockets/?sku=REV-21-3744-PK5', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/867/images/3435/REV-21-3706-3731-ION35Sprockets-FamilyHero-FINAL__40419.1733848051.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#35 Roller Chain - 10ft', 'REV-21-3745', 'Designed for teams requiring higher load capacity in chain-driven systems, the ION #35 Sprockets come in three versatile options, each compatible with the REV ION Build System: #35 Hub Sprockets - 1/2in Hex: Featuring a 1/2in hex bore (rounded for the 9T size) and dual raised hubs for centered alignment on a 0.5in width, these sprockets are ideal for compact spaces. The 1/2in hex bore enables the smallest sprockets with the fewest teeth, accommodating a wider range of reduction options. Our…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-35-Sprockets/?sku=REV-21-3745', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/867/images/3435/REV-21-3706-3731-ION35Sprockets-FamilyHero-FINAL__40419.1733848051.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Bushing - Plastic - 13.75mm ID - 0.75in OD - 8 Pack', 'REV-21-3900-PK8', 'Bearings 15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack (REV-21-3294-PK4) Featuring a 8mm internal diameter and a 1.125in outer diameter, this bearing is designed to fit into a MAXSpline bore while supporting a 15T Spline shaft. The flange adds a way to retain it in place while this bearing supports high-speed loads from many forms of mechanisms that are driven by a 15T Spline shaft including supporting the end of motor shafts. 1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Bearings/?sku=REV-21-3900-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/871/images/3433/ION_Bearings-Family-Hero-FINAL__10655.1733763769.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
