  ('Bushing - Plastic - 13.75mm ID - 1.125in OD - 8 Pack', 'REV-21-3903-PK8', 'Bearings 15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack (REV-21-3294-PK4) Featuring a 8mm internal diameter and a 1.125in outer diameter, this bearing is designed to fit into a MAXSpline bore while supporting a 15T Spline shaft. The flange adds a way to retain it in place while this bearing supports high-speed loads from many forms of mechanisms that are driven by a 15T Spline shaft including supporting the end of motor shafts. 1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Bearings/?sku=REV-21-3903-PK8', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/871/images/3433/ION_Bearings-Family-Hero-FINAL__10655.1733763769.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('20DP Gear - 15T Spline - 24T', 'REV-21-4005', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. This gear features a 15T spline bore for use with 15T spline shaft and motors like our NEO 2.0 Brushless Motor. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gears - MAXSpline and 20DP Gears - 1/2in Hex page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Diametral Pitch: 20 Thickness:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-15T-Spline?sku=REV-21-4005', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/928/images/3634/20DPGears-15TSpline_FAMILY_FINAL__97556.1764103569.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
