  ('20DP Gear - 15T Spline - 20T', 'REV-21-4007', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. This gear features a 15T spline bore for use with 15T spline shaft and motors like our NEO 2.0 Brushless Motor. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gears - MAXSpline and 20DP Gears - 1/2in Hex page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Diametral Pitch: 20 Thickness:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-15T-Spline?sku=REV-21-4007', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/928/images/3634/20DPGears-15TSpline_FAMILY_FINAL__97556.1764103569.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('20DP Gear - 15T Spline - 18T', 'REV-21-4008', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. This gear features a 15T spline bore for use with 15T spline shaft and motors like our NEO 2.0 Brushless Motor. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gears - MAXSpline and 20DP Gears - 1/2in Hex page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Diametral Pitch: 20 Thickness:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-15T-Spline?sku=REV-21-4008', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/928/images/3634/20DPGears-15TSpline_FAMILY_FINAL__97556.1764103569.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products / New FRC Products', 'rev'),
  ('20DP NEO Pinion Gear - 15T Spline - 14T', 'REV-21-4010', 'The NEO Pinions are used for transferring power from a NEO Brushless Motor or something with a similar matching shaft to a mechanism. These pinions come in three different types; either gear, sprocket, or pulley. The pinion gears are compatible with 20DP gears. The pinion sprocket is used with #25 chain and the pinion pulley is used with GT2 3mm timing belts. These pinions either come compatible with 8mm round shafts with a 2mm keyway or 15T Spline shafts. The 10, 11, and 12 Tooth Pinion Gears…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/neo-pinions/?sku=REV-21-4010', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/588/images/1850/REV-21-0000-Pinion_Gear-Family-FINAL__60560.1612816510.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('20DP NEO Pinion Gear - 15T Spline - 13T', 'REV-21-4011', 'The NEO Pinions are used for transferring power from a NEO Brushless Motor or something with a similar matching shaft to a mechanism. These pinions come in three different types; either gear, sprocket, or pulley. The pinion gears are compatible with 20DP gears. The pinion sprocket is used with #25 chain and the pinion pulley is used with GT2 3mm timing belts. These pinions either come compatible with 8mm round shafts with a 2mm keyway or 15T Spline shafts. The 10, 11, and 12 Tooth Pinion Gears…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/neo-pinions/?sku=REV-21-4011', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/588/images/1850/REV-21-0000-Pinion_Gear-Family-FINAL__60560.1612816510.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('20DP NEO Pinion Gear - 15T Spline - 12T', 'REV-21-4012', 'The NEO Pinions are used for transferring power from a NEO Brushless Motor or something with a similar matching shaft to a mechanism. These pinions come in three different types; either gear, sprocket, or pulley. The pinion gears are compatible with 20DP gears. The pinion sprocket is used with #25 chain and the pinion pulley is used with GT2 3mm timing belts. These pinions either come compatible with 8mm round shafts with a 2mm keyway or 15T Spline shafts. The 10, 11, and 12 Tooth Pinion Gears…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/neo-pinions/?sku=REV-21-4012', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/588/images/1850/REV-21-0000-Pinion_Gear-Family-FINAL__60560.1612816510.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('20DP NEO Pinion Gear - 15T Spline - 11T', 'REV-21-4013', 'The NEO Pinions are used for transferring power from a NEO Brushless Motor or something with a similar matching shaft to a mechanism. These pinions come in three different types; either gear, sprocket, or pulley. The pinion gears are compatible with 20DP gears. The pinion sprocket is used with #25 chain and the pinion pulley is used with GT2 3mm timing belts. These pinions either come compatible with 8mm round shafts with a 2mm keyway or 15T Spline shafts. The 10, 11, and 12 Tooth Pinion Gears…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/neo-pinions/?sku=REV-21-4013', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/588/images/1850/REV-21-0000-Pinion_Gear-Family-FINAL__60560.1612816510.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('20DP NEO Pinion Gear - 15T Spline - 10T', 'REV-21-4014', 'The NEO Pinions are used for transferring power from a NEO Brushless Motor or something with a similar matching shaft to a mechanism. These pinions come in three different types; either gear, sprocket, or pulley. The pinion gears are compatible with 20DP gears. The pinion sprocket is used with #25 chain and the pinion pulley is used with GT2 3mm timing belts. These pinions either come compatible with 8mm round shafts with a 2mm keyway or 15T Spline shafts. The 10, 11, and 12 Tooth Pinion Gears…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/neo-pinions/?sku=REV-21-4014', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/588/images/1850/REV-21-0000-Pinion_Gear-Family-FINAL__60560.1612816510.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('Adjustable Tube Mount - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-4016-PK2', 'The Adjustable Tube Mount is a precision machined aluminum bracket designed to give teams fine control over how 2x1 MAXTube attaches to robot structure. Three center counterbored holes allow a MAXTube Endcap to bolt on flush, creating a clean mounting interface for perpendicular tube assemblies. Elongated, counterbored mounting slots on each side provide precise lateral adjustment, making it easy to correct for off pitch spacing, achieve exact alignment, or tension belts and chain with ease.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-4016-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/943/images/3664/REV-21-4016_HERO_FINAL__15286.1764956031.500.500.jpg?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('6mm Round Belt Pulley - 1/2in Hex - 2in OD - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-4018-PK2', 'The ION Round Belt System provides a simple and adaptable way to transfer power in compact robot mechanisms. Designed around a 2in outer diameter when the belt is installed, the system stays on pitch with the REV ION wheel lineup, making it easy to integrate into intakes, conveyors, feeders, and other custom assemblies. At its core is a solid polyurethane round belt that can be cut to length and heat welded to form custom closed loops. Trimming the belt about 8 percent shorter than the final…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-round-belt-system?sku=REV-21-4018-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/939/images/3670/RoundBeltSystem_Family_FINAL__29622.1764963913.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('6mm Round Belt Pulley - MAXSpline - 2in OD - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-4019-PK2', 'The ION Round Belt System provides a simple and adaptable way to transfer power in compact robot mechanisms. Designed around a 2in outer diameter when the belt is installed, the system stays on pitch with the REV ION wheel lineup, making it easy to integrate into intakes, conveyors, feeders, and other custom assemblies. At its core is a solid polyurethane round belt that can be cut to length and heat welded to form custom closed loops. Trimming the belt about 8 percent shorter than the final…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-round-belt-system?sku=REV-21-4019-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/939/images/3670/RoundBeltSystem_Family_FINAL__29622.1764963913.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('Polyurethane Round Belt - 6mm - Solid Core - 50ft', 'REV-21-4020', 'The ION Round Belt System provides a simple and adaptable way to transfer power in compact robot mechanisms. Designed around a 2in outer diameter when the belt is installed, the system stays on pitch with the REV ION wheel lineup, making it easy to integrate into intakes, conveyors, feeders, and other custom assemblies. At its core is a solid polyurethane round belt that can be cut to length and heat welded to form custom closed loops. Trimming the belt about 8 percent shorter than the final…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-round-belt-system?sku=REV-21-4020', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/939/images/3670/RoundBeltSystem_Family_FINAL__29622.1764963913.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('32 Tooth - 1/2in Width - RT25 Belt', 'REV-21-4032', 'RT25 Belts are toothed belts with a 1/4in pitch are compatible with the REV ION System. These belts are comparable in strength to the belts that teams are used to using while working on the pitch of the ION build system. Belts are lighter than chain and can operate at higher speeds. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity for mechanisms like drivetrains, intakes, and shooters. Features On pitch with the ION Build System Specifications Material: Body: Neoprene Cords: Fiberglass Pitch:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Belts-1/2in-Width/?sku=REV-21-4032', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/698/images/2669/4120-edit__69834.1650404239.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
